  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "するどく　とがった　あごが　じまん。\nすこしでも　うごくものを　みつけると\nいっちょくせんに　とつげきする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "날카롭고 뾰족한 턱을 자랑한다.\n조금이라도 움직이는 것을 발견하면\n일직선으로 돌격한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "尖銳的下巴是牠的驕傲。\n只要發現周圍有什麼小動作，\n就會一直線衝過去。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa mâchoire fine et aiguisée fait sa fierté.\nÀ peine voit-il le moindre mouvement\nqu’il fonce dans sa direction.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein spitz zulaufender Kiefer ist sein ganzer Stolz.\nErblickt es etwas, das sich auch nur ein bisschen\nbewegt, setzt es geradewegs zum Stoßangriff an.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se siente muy orgulloso de su afilada mandíbula.\nEn cuanto detecta el más mínimo movimiento,\nva directo al objetivo para cargar contra él.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Va orgoglioso della sua mandibola appuntita.\nAppena nota il minimo movimento, parte subito\nall’attacco.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "If it sees any movement around it, this Pokémon\ncharges for it straightaway, leading with its\nsharply pointed jaw. It’s very proud of that jaw.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "鋭く　尖った　顎が　自慢。\n少しでも　動くものを　見つけると\n一直線に　突撃する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "尖锐的下巴是它的骄傲。\n只要发现周围有什么小动作，\n就会一直线冲过去。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se siente muy orgulloso de su afilada mandíbula.\nEn cuanto detecta el más mínimo movimiento,\nva directo al objetivo para cargar contra él.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "はらいっぱいで　きょくたんに\nうごきが　にぶった　ところを\nウッウに　まるのみに　される。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "배가 불러서 현저히\n움직임이 둔해지면\n윽우지가 통째로 삼켜버린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "吃飽了之後動作會變得\n極度遲緩，於是就被\n古月鳥整隻吞了下去。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lorsqu’il a le ventre plein, il a beaucoup\nplus de mal à se déplacer, et c’est à ce moment\nprécis qu’il se fait gober par les Nigosier.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Seine Bewegungsfreiheit ist stark eingeschränkt,\nwenn es vollgefressen ist. So wird es zu leichter\nBeute für Urgl, das es im Ganzen verschlingt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando tiene el estómago lleno, le cuesta\nmoverse y corre el riesgo de ser engullido por\nalgún Cramorant.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quando ha la pancia piena i suoi movimenti\nsi fanno estremamente lenti e rischia di finire\ninghiottito da un Cramorant.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "After it’s eaten its fill, its movements become\nextremely sluggish. That’s when Cramorant\nswallows it up.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "腹一杯で　極端に\n動きが　鈍った　ところを\nウッウに　丸飲みに　される。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "吃饱了之后动作会变得\n极度迟缓，于是就被\n古月鸟整只吞了下去。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando tiene el estómago lleno, le cuesta\nmoverse y corre el riesgo de ser engullido por\nalgún Cramorant.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "まっすぐにしか　はやく　およげない。たべすぎて　うごきが　にぶいものからカイデンの　むれに　ねらわれる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "직선으로만 빠르게 헤엄칠 수 있다. 너무 많이 먹어 움직임이 둔해진 녀석부터 찌리비 무리에게 노려진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "游泳只能游直線。因吃太飽而行動變得遲緩的個體會先遭到電海燕的群體襲擊。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ne nage vite qu’en ligne droite. Quand il mange trop, il devient maladroit et des volées de Zapétrel le prennent pour cible.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es kann nur geradeaus schwimmend schnell sein. Überfressene Pikuda sind träge und geraten so zuerst ins Visier von Voltrel-Schwärmen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Solo puede nadar rápido en línea recta. Las bandadas de Wattrel atacan primero a los que les cuesta moverse por haber comido de más.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Riesce a nuotare velocemente solo in linea retta. Quando mangia troppo i suoi movimenti si fanno lenti e gli stormi di Wattrel lo prendono di mira.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Arrokuda can swim quickly only in a straight line. The ones that become sluggish from overeating are the first to be targeted by flocks of Wattrel.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "真っ直ぐにしか　速く　泳げない。食べ過ぎて　動きが　鈍いものからカイデンの　群れに　狙われる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "只能直线游泳。因吃太饱而动作变得迟缓的个体会先遭到电海燕的群体袭击。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Solo puede nadar rápido en línea recta. Las bandadas de Wattrel atacan primero a los que les cuesta moverse por haber comido de más.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
