        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "かたく　とがった　あごで　とつげきしえものを　しとめる。しりょくが　わるいので　せいこうりつは　ひくい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "단단하고 뾰족한 턱으로 돌격하여 먹잇감을 해치운다. 시력이 좋지 않아서 성공률은 낮다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會用又尖又硬的下巴發動突擊來捕殺獵物。視力很差，因此成功率很低。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il charge ses proies puis les abat d’un coup de sa mâchoire aussi dure qu’effilée. Comme il a une mauvaise vue, son taux de réussite est faible.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Beute erlegt es durch Stoßangriffe mit seinem harten, spitzen Kiefer. Wegen seines schlechten Sehvermögens ist die Erfolgsquote jedoch gering.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Carga contra sus presas con su dura y afilada mandíbula para acabar con ellas, pero es habitual que falle debido a su mala visión.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Carica le prede per abbatterle con la sua mandibola dura e appuntita, ma è debole di vista quindi non fa spesso centro.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It takes down prey by charging into them with its hard, pointed jaw. But Arrokuda’s eyesight is poor, so this tactic has a low success rate.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
